## Tunables (in `route_composer/types.py`)

| Constant | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `NAVMESH_TOLERANCE_CM` | 50.0 | XZ tolerance for "is this position on a NavMesh?" inside the composer (bird-eye pins use magnet distance separately) |
| `OSM_SEGMENT_SPEED` | 5.0 | Per-segment speed multiplier for OSM crossings (≈15 m/s on top of the ~3 m/s base) |
| `NAVMESH_SEGMENT_SPEED` | 1.0 | Per-segment speed multiplier for NavMesh segments (base speed) |
| `DEFAULT_WALK_SPEED_M_PER_S` | 1.3 | Base walking speed for the ETA estimate; matches `route_measure.constants.DEFAULT_WALK_SPEED_M_PER_S` |
| `DEFAULT_ISLAND` | `"scandinavium"` | Legacy fallback for entrance waypoints without an island prefix |
| `ENTRANCE_PREFIX` | `"nav_waypoint_entrance_"` | Entrance prim name prefix |
| `RouteComposer._OSM_ENTRY_FORWARD_BIAS_CM` | 500.0 | Forward-bias distance for the OSM `nearest_node` probe (avoids 180° hooks at the bridge) |

